<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Messages - P2P Tool Library</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@@5.3.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/bootstrap-overrides.css?v=1">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/responsive.css">
    <style>
        .messages-layout { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 300px 1fr; gap: 1rem; }
        .convo-list, .chat-panel { background: white; border-radius: var(--bs-border-radius); box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.08); overflow: hidden; }
        .convo-item { padding: 1rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--bs-border-color); cursor: pointer; }
        .convo-item:hover, .convo-item.active { background: rgba(44,125,160,.08); }
        .chat-body { height: 480px; overflow-y: auto; padding: 1.25rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: .75rem; }
        .msg { max-width: 72%; padding: .75rem 1rem; border-radius: 1rem; font-size: .9rem; line-height: 1.45; }
        .msg.them { background: var(--bs-light); align-self: flex-start; }
        .msg.me { background: rgba(44,125,160,.12); align-self: flex-end; }
        .msg .meta { display: block; font-size: .7rem; color: var(--bs-secondary-color); margin-top: .25rem; }
        .chat-input { padding: 1rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--bs-border-color); display: flex; gap: .5rem; }
        @@media (max-width: 991.98px) { .messages-layout { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <nav class="navbar navbar-expand-lg navbar-light bg-white shadow-sm sticky-top">
        <div class="container-fluid">
            <a class="navbar-brand logo" href="/Home/Index"><i class="fas fa-tools"></i><span>ToolShare</span></a>
            <button class="navbar-toggler" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#mainNav" aria-controls="mainNav" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Toggle navigation"><span class="navbar-toggler-icon"></span></button>
            <div class="collapse navbar-collapse" id="mainNav">
                <ul class="navbar-nav ms-auto align-items-lg-center gap-lg-2">
                    <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/Home/Index"><i class="fas fa-home"></i> Home</a></li>
                    <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/Home/tools"><i class="fas fa-search"></i> Browse Tools</a></li>
                    <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/Member/memberdashboard"><i class="fas fa-gauge-high"></i> Dashboard</a></li>
                    <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/Member/mytools"><i class="fas fa-toolbox"></i> My Tools</a></li>
                    <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/Member/mybookings"><i class="fas fa-calendar-check"></i> Bookings</a></li>
                    <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link active" href="/Home/messages"><i class="fas fa-envelope"></i> Messages</a></li>
                    <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/Member/wallet"><i class="fas fa-wallet"></i> Wallet</a></li>
                    <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/Member/notifications"><i class="fas fa-bell"></i> Alerts</a></li>
                    <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/Home/profile"><i class="fas fa-user"></i> Profile</a></li>
                    <li class="nav-item"><button class="btn btn-outline-secondary"><i class="fas fa-sign-out-alt"></i> Logout</button></li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <main class="py-5">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="mb-4">
                <h1 class="h2 fw-bold mb-1"><i class="fas fa-envelope text-primary me-2"></i>Messages</h1>
                <p class="text-muted mb-0">Private in-app messaging with contact details masked.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="messages-layout">
                <div class="convo-list">
                    <div class="convo-item active">
                        <div class="d-flex gap-2 align-items-start"><div class="rounded-circle bg-primary text-white d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center" style="width:40px;height:40px;flex:0 0 40px;"><i class="fas fa-user"></i></div><div class="flex-grow-1"><div class="d-flex justify-content-between"><strong class="small">Ahmed Hassan</strong><span class="badge text-bg-info" style="font-size:.6rem;">#1012</span></div><div class="text-muted small text-truncate">ممكن ألمس الآلة قبل التسليم؟</div></div></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="convo-item">
                        <div class="d-flex gap-2 align-items-start"><div class="rounded-circle bg-success text-white d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center" style="width:40px;height:40px;flex:0 0 40px;"><i class="fas fa-user"></i></div><div class="flex-grow-1"><strong class="small">Monika Adel</strong><div class="text-muted small text-truncate">تم تسليم الأداة من غير مشاكل</div></div></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="convo-item">
                        <div class="d-flex gap-2 align-items-start"><div class="rounded-circle bg-warning text-dark d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center" style="width:40px;height:40px;flex:0 0 40px;"><i class="fas fa-user"></i></div><div class="flex-grow-1"><strong class="small">Sara Mostafa</strong><div class="text-muted small text-truncate">الأداة مرجعة والفحص شغال</div></div></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="convo-item">
                        <div class="d-flex gap-2 align-items-start"><div class="rounded-circle bg-secondary text-white d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center" style="width:40px;height:40px;flex:0 0 40px;"><i class="fas fa-rss"></i></div><div class="flex-grow-1"><strong class="small">Library broadcast</strong><div class="text-muted small text-truncate">صيانة جماعية يوم الجمعة</div></div></div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="chat-panel d-flex flex-column">
                    <div class="p-3 border-bottom d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center">
                        <div><i class="fas fa-user me-2"></i><strong>Ahmed Hassan</strong> <span class="badge text-bg-primary">booking #1012</span></div>
                        <span class="badge text-bg-success">contact hidden</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="chat-body">
                        <div class="msg them">السلام عليكم، عندي حجز على الدردل يوم 20 أكتوبر. ممكن ألمس الآلة قبل التسليم؟<span class="meta">Ahmed Hassan — 09:12 AM</span></div>
                        <div class="msg me">أهلاً Ahmed 👋 الأداة متاحة في مكتبة Nasr City ساعة 19 قبل موعد التسليم، والموعد بيتأكد بالـ QR عند الاستلام.<span class="meta">Support — 09:30 AM</span></div>
                        <div class="msg them">تمام، شكراً! هناك إيداع 500 جنيه مأخوذ مع التسعير؟<span class="meta">Ahmed Hassan — 09:45 AM</span></div>
                        <div class="msg me">أيوه، محجوز في Escrow وبيتسدد تلقائي بعد الرجوع في طريق سليم.<span class="meta">Support — 09:52 AM</span></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="chat-input">
                        <input type="text" class="form-control" placeholder="Type a message…">
                        <button class="btn btn-primary"><i class="fas fa-paper-plane"></i></button>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="alert alert-light border mt-3"><i class="fas fa-shield-alt text-primary"></i> Real phone numbers and emails are never shown inside the chat.</div>
        </div>
    </main>

    <footer class="footer py-4 mt-5"><div class="container text-center text-muted"><p class="mb-1">© 2024 ToolShare. All rights reserved.</p><div class="d-flex justify-content-center gap-3"><a href="/Home/privacy" class="text-decoration-none">Privacy Policy</a><a href="/Home/terms" class="text-decoration-none">Terms of Service</a><a href="/Home/support" class="text-decoration-none">Safety Guidelines</a></div></div></footer>

    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@@5.3.3/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
    <script src="/js/ui.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
